# THE CALIBRATION BUNDLE IS HASHED BYTE FOR BYTE.
#
# `data/calibration/**` is verified against a manifest of SHA-256 digests, and the
# manifest's own `bundle_sha256` is recomputed from those digests before any run. A
# checkout that rewrote line endings would break every one of them at once — and it
# would do so silently, at clone time, on a machine nobody was watching.
#
# This is not hypothetical: `core.autocrlf=true` is set on the machine this bundle was
# copied from, and `crypto-lab` (the producer) had to pin the same files for the same
# reason. The bundle is byte-identical across the two repositories only as long as both
# pin it.
data/calibration/** -text

# Belt and braces for the payload type itself, in case the bundle ever moves.
*.json text eol=lf
